Kribugs Ogre Full
    Events
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- SET COUNTER --------
        Set VariableSet KribugsOgreFullCount = (KribugsOgreFullCount + 1)
        -------- SET COUNTER --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                KribugsOgreFullCount Greater than or equal to 5
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet KribugsOgreFull = True
                -------- Full active --------
                Unit - Add Fart Cloud (Neutral Hostile no damage) to Kribugs
                Unit - Set Unit: Kribugs's Integer Field: Tinting Color 1 (Red) ('uclr') to Value: 155
                Unit - Set Unit: Kribugs's Integer Field: Tinting Color 2 (Green) ('uclg') to Value: 255
                Unit - Set Unit: Kribugs's Integer Field: Tinting Color 3 (Blue) ('uclb') to Value: 175
                Trigger - Turn on Kribugs Ogre Full Active <gen>
            Else - Actions
